Dear Nadia

=20

As I said on Monday at 19:47 I had hoped to respond to the emails you have =
set since we met on the afternoon of Thursday 29th today but I have since re=
ceived c.8 emails from you which I have not been able to assimilate. They ar=
e very dense. Faye has been working with you yesterday and today on the Oxus=
 matter because you say it is urgent.

=20

I have asked Faye to send you a notice of acting in person so that you can =
engage directly with the Karim=E2=80=99s legal team and the court, as you have req=
uested. Please sign and return it to us and Faye wil file it.

=20

The final bill is being prepared in the sum =C2=A340,000 plus disbursements. Th=
ere is just =C2=A331,087 on account to meet that bill so there are no funds for =
ongoing work. Brent and I will obviously comply with our obligations to the =
court in relation to judgment.

=20

Very best

