on to these ad hoc to these further messages.

I understand Mrs Zahmoul continues to write directly to third parties about=
 the case. This must stop.=20

Would you please order Mrs Zahmoul to desist with contacting third parties =
about the case or sending evidence to the court pending your determination?

The evidence is closed. Mrs Zahmoul has solicitors on the record. If she wi=
shes to re-open the evidence (without our consent) she needs to make a forma=
l application to do so.=20

I apologise for the unsolicited message.

Best wishes,

Alexis Campbell

